    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「いえいえ。１００％感謝しかしてない、って言ったら嘘になりますけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「怨むこともないです、やっぱり両親ですもん。愛してますよ、心から」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「子供のころから、父も母も忙しくて。あんまり会えないのは、寂しいけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「でも、あたしは両親と同じことを、相方にしちゃったから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「ことりんをアイドルに仕立てあげて、親元から引き離して、招き寄せちゃったから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「だから両親を怨んだりする筋合いなんて、ないんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「それは自分自身の人生も、何もかもぜんぶ、否定することになっちゃいそうで……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「それに、あたしにはことりんがいます。学校のみんなもいる、長居殿、桐島殿……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-miko",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -34,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つばさ",
    "text": "「だから寂しくないですし、わりと幸せでありますよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 65,
    "dress": "old-miko",
